ely than his late-career marks [jordan_defense_3840].\n\n---\n\n### **Subjective vs. Factual Distinctions**\n* **Factual Metric Evidence:** Jordan’s defensive plus-minus in 1997–1998 placed around 35th among scaled four-year peaks [jordan_defense_3840]. \n* **Subjective / Evaluative Judgments:** While both are framed as premier historical wings, the comparative assessment ranks James’s apex defense as slightly superior to Jordan’s [lebron_defense_3520], while noting neither perimeter player achieves the needle-moving defensive impact of a dominant interior big man [jordan_defense_3840].","refusal":null,"role":"assistant","annotations":null,"audio":null,"function_call":null,"tool_calls":null,"extra_content":{"google":{"thought_signature":""}}}}],"created":1792371741,"model":"gemini-3.8-flash","object":"chat.completion","service_tier":null,"system_fingerprint":null,"usage":{"completion_tokens":589,"prompt_tokens":1263,"total_tokens":2813,"completion_tokens_details":null,"prompt_tokens_details":null}}